 of art, architecture, and government spaces.","evidence_claim":"Minnesota Historical Society states that admission to the Minnesota State Capitol is free and that self-guided tours are available.","source_url":"https://www.mnhs.org/capitol/visit/hours","source_title":"Hours and Admission | Minnesota State Capitol","source_kind":"cultural_institution","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Official page lists public building hours and free guided-tour times. Guided-tour donations are suggested, not required.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"minneapolis-sculpture-garden","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Minneapolis Sculpture Garden","title":"Stroll the Minneapolis Sculpture Garden","subtitle":"725 Vineland Place, Minneapolis","notes":"Take a self-guided loop through the outdoor works and gardens, then use the free digital guide if you want context for specific pieces. No ticket is needed.","short_summary":"An all-year outdoor art walk with free public access.","evidence_claim":"Walker Art Center says the Minneapolis Sculpture Garden requires no tickets and is always free to the public.","source_url":"https://www.walkerart.org/minneapolis-sculpture-garden/","source_title":"Minneapolis Sculpture Garden | Walker Art Center","source_kind":"cultural_institution","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Open daily, year-round, 6 a.m.–midnight according to Walker Art Center.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"phalen-regional-park-beach","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Phalen Regional Park Beach","title":"Swim or sit by Phalen Beach","subtitle":"1400 Phalen Drive, Saint Paul","notes":"Bring what you need for a beach afternoon and use the guarded sand beach during its posted season. Watercraft rentals are optional and not part of this free plan.","sho